return {
    ["\n \n                是谁造成了这一切？\n    <Letter_Highlight_HW>管家、医生、男爵夫人、仆人，</>            \n                凶手是他们中的哪个？"] = "\n \n                Who caused all of this?\n    <Letter_Highlight_HW>Butler, doctor, baroness, servant,</>            \n                Which one of them is the murderer?",
    ["%s将会长一职转让给您，望%s俱乐部在您的带领下欣欣向荣"] = "%s has transferred the President position to you; may Club %s flourish under your leadership.",
    ["%s，好久不见：\n      我听说了你最近与厄水巨龟艰辛的交战。辛苦了，你一直都很努力。我和苏茜搜集了一些有关厄水巨龟的情报，希望能有所帮助：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302106\">厄水巨龟的记载</>\n      你所承受的命运写满了未知与危险，连我们也无法勘破你身上的迷雾和谜团。未来或许还有更多的险境、更大的危机在等待着我们。我们都需要变得更强，才能保护好自己和珍视的事物。但当你疲惫的时候，欢迎随时来命运咖啡厅坐坐，我这里有不错的红茶和糕点，或许你会喜欢。闲暇的时候，可以来陪我和苏茜聊聊天，让心态平和下来，一切都会好起来的。\n      不用担心，我和其他人都会尽力帮助你，随信附上一些提升实力的建议。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看</>"] = "%s, long time no see: \n      I heard about your recent arduous battle with the Misfortune Water Giant Turtle. You've worked hard; you have always been very diligent. Susie and I have gathered some intelligence regarding the Misfortune Water Giant Turtle, and I hope it proves helpful: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302106\">Records of the Misfortune Water Giant Turtle</>\n      The fate you bear is filled with unknowns and dangers; even we cannot pierce through the mist and mysteries surrounding you. Perhaps more perilous situations and greater crises await us in the future. We all need to become stronger to protect ourselves and the things we cherish. But when you are exhausted, you are always welcome to come to the Fate Café for a seat. I have some excellent black tea and pastries here that you might enjoy. In your spare time, feel free to come chat with Susie and me to calm your mind; everything will be alright. \n      Do not worry; I and the others will do our best to help you. Attached to this letter are some suggestions for improving your strength. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
    ["25年了，人们还是这么喜爱这部戏。"] = "It's been 25 years, and people still love this play so much.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>心灵共鸣</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>社交-好友聊天\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>与任意好友的好友度达到心灵共鸣"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Spiritual Resonance</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Social-Friend Chat\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Spiritual Resonance with any friend",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>龟龟！</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>冒险-队伍副本\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>击杀普通难度厄水巨龟"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Turtle!</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Adventure - Team Dungeon\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Defeat Misfortune Water Giant Turtle on Normal difficulty",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n　　《诡秘之主》游戏的公测版本终于迎来了与非凡者的相见之日。非凡世界的大门在此为您敞开，欢迎来到诡秘之主的世界！\n　　为庆祝非凡者跨越灰雾，从旧日而来，降临到这个世界，我们特此献上了一份您的专属礼物表达感谢。\n　　感谢您的参与，您将是诡秘之主世界中恢弘故事展开的重要一环。期待您在非凡世界日后的冒险之旅，祝您旅途愉快！"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n The open beta version of the Lord of Mysteries game has finally arrived to meet the Beyonders. The doors to the Extraordinary World are open for you here; welcome to the world of Lord of Mysteries! \n To celebrate Beyonders crossing the gray fog, coming from the Great Old One, and descending into this world, we have specially presented an exclusive gift to express our gratitude. \n Thank you for your participation. You will be an important part of the unfolding of the magnificent story in the world of Lord of Mysteries. We look forward to your future adventures in the Extraordinary World. Have a pleasant journey!",
    ["<P_Heart>（会长说过，会一直守着我。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The President said she would always watch over me.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（好、好长……而且好像什么尊名……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (So, so long... and it sounds like some kind of honorific name...) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（电流爆鸣声）</>喂……到吗……醒……那是……阱……"] = "<P_Heart>(Electrical crackling)</> Hello... can you... hear... wake... that is... trap...",
    ["To 非凡者\n    我们是守护者，也是一群\n    时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的\n    可怜虫。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Beyonder \n We are Guardians, but also a group of \n poor wretches constantly fighting against danger and madness. \n \n Squid Who Loves to Dive",
    ["[廷根(分线1)(9994,767)]"] = "[Tingen (Branch 1)(9994,767)]",
    ["{\n                        \"轻攻击\": \"LightHit\",\n                        \"默认击退\": \"HitBack\",\n                        \"击退100cm_控制0.3秒\": \"HitBack_100_9F\",\n                        \"击退200cm_控制0.3秒\": \"HitBack_200_9F\",\n                        \"击退300cm_控制0.3秒\": \"HitBack_300_9F\",\n                        \"击倒\": \"HitDown\",\n                        \"击飞\": \"HitFly\",\n                        \"挑空\": \"HitFloat\",\n                        \"拖拽\": \"HitDrag\",\n                        \"僵直攻击\": \"HitStiff\"\n                    }"] = "{\n \"Light Attack\": \"LightHit\", \n \"Default Knockback\": \"HitBack\", \n \"Knockback 100cm_Control 0.3s\": \"HitBack_100_9F\", \n \"Knockback 200cm_Control 0.3s\": \"HitBack_200_9F\", \n \"Knockback 300cm_Control 0.3s\": \"HitBack_300_9F\", \n \"Knockdown\": \"HitDown\", \n \"Knockup\": \"HitFly\", \n \"Launch\": \"HitFloat\", \n \"Drag\": \"HitDrag\", \n \"Stiff Attack\": \"HitStiff\" \n}",
    ["　　从我们毕业到现在，已经过去了五年。战争的阴霾已从家乡的上空离开，一切都回到了最初的模样，甚至比当初更好。我想，贝克兰德一定恢复的比这里更迅速。\n　　听说现在的你成了大经理，我由衷地为你闪耀的前途而感到高兴，小镇出身的姑娘如今走到这样的高度，命运终于恰当的奖赏了应当奖赏的人。\n　　我本想来贝克兰德当面庆贺，但小米勒最近的身体状况不大好，因此你的旅游邀约我不得不暂时拒绝。但别担心，亲爱的，我想我们未来总会有时间再见一面。"] = "It has been five years since we graduated. The shadow of war has lifted from our hometown, and everything has returned to how it was, or even better. I imagine Backlund must have recovered even faster than here.\nI heard you have become a great manager now, and I am sincerely happy for your bright future. A girl from a small town has reached such heights; fate has finally rewarded those who deserve it.\nI intended to come to Backlund to congratulate you in person, but little Miller's health hasn't been great lately, so I have to decline your travel invitation for now. But don't worry, my dear, I believe we will have time to meet again in the future.",
    ["　　子弹追回二十三颗……但死了很多人，这值不值得呢？我不知道。这城市烂透了。但总得有人去挖出这些烂肉——哪怕只剩我一个。\n　　如果下次再有这种事，我可能还得找你。毕竟我也没有其他可以信任的人了。\n　　最近我发现自己好像影子都变淡了，大概是酒喝多了。你也要注意身体。"] = "Twenty-three bullets recovered… but so many people died. Is it worth it? I don't know. This city is rotten to the core. But someone has to dig out this rotting flesh—even if I'm the only one left.\nIf something like this happens again, I might have to come to you. After all, I have no one else I can trust.\nRecently, I've noticed my shadow seems to be fading; it's probably because I've been drinking too much. You should take care of your health too.",
